    <string name="prototype_title">ImHere — widget prototype</string>
    <string name="prototype_subtitle">Verification build for the SOS widget. Double tap the widget to start a foreground location request. No SMS is sent in the prototype.</string>
    <string name="prototype_instructions">1. Grant permissions.\n2. Add the ImHere widget to the home screen (long press on the home screen → Widgets).\n3. Tap the widget once, then a second time within 2 seconds.\n4. Watch the notification and the Logcat tag ImHerePrototype.</string>
